# Local Supabase stack (npm run dev:local → vite --mode localdb).
#
# These are the CLI's universal local-dev defaults printed by `supabase start`
# — NOT secrets. They only ever address the throwaway local stack on this
# machine, so they are committed so `npm run dev:local` works out of the box.
# Your real remote credentials stay in the gitignored .env.local (npm run dev).
#
# If a future CLI upgrade changes these, re-read them from `npm run db:status`.
